+The Venn diagram below shows the bugs detected by SmartFuzz, \tool{}, and their combination. SmartFuzz and \tool{} share 5 bugs (4 on MonetDB and 1 on DuckDB). SmartFuzz detects 12 bugs that \tool{} misses (7, 3, 1, and 1 on MonetDB, Virtuoso, DuckDB, and ClickHouse, respectively), and \tool{} detects 17 bugs that SmartFuzz misses (10, 3, 2, and 2, respectively). The combination detects 29 of the 34 bugs detected by SmartFuzz or \tool{} alone, missing 5 bugs on MonetDB, and additionally detects 6 bugs (4 on MonetDB and 2 on Virtuoso) that neither SmartFuzz nor \tool{} detects alone.
